From 49045c3465d21bec855666831e927edf4b3da1cf Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Niklas Sheth <hi@niklassheth.com>
Date: Tue, 18 Aug 2026 23:07:33 -0400
Subject: [PATCH] drm/apple: bring up T8132 HDMI audio

Recover unplugged PCM streams as XRUNs, complete SIO termination before invalidating link state, and admit persistent streams to the reconnected display generation. Use an ordered reclaim-safe workqueue for SIO termination.

Assisted-By: OpenAI Codex (GPT-5.6 Sol)
Signed-off-by: Niklas Sheth <hi@niklassheth.com>
---
 .../devicetree/bindings/dma/apple,sio.yaml    |   1 +
 arch/arm64/boot/dts/apple/t8132-j773g.dts     |  17 ++
 arch/arm64/boot/dts/apple/t8132.dtsi          |  72 +++++
 drivers/dma/apple-sio.c                       |  33 ++-
 drivers/gpu/drm/apple/Kconfig                 |   1 +
 drivers/gpu/drm/apple/afk.c                   |   8 +-
 drivers/gpu/drm/apple/afk.h                   |   2 +-
 drivers/gpu/drm/apple/audio.c                 | 245 ++++++++++++++++--
 drivers/gpu/drm/apple/av.c                    | 228 +++++++++++++---
 drivers/gpu/drm/apple/av.h                    |  10 +
 drivers/gpu/drm/apple/dcp.c                   |  28 +-
 drivers/gpu/drm/apple/dptxep.c                |  36 ++-
 12 files changed, 609 insertions(+), 72 deletions(-)

diff --git a/Documentation/devicetree/bindings/dma/apple,sio.yaml b/Documentation/devicetree/bindings/dma/apple,sio.yaml
